{
	quest.038E446BEFD2BBE6.quest_desc: [
		"The rarest essence there is."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Creative Essence and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.038E446BEFD2BBE6.title: "Creative Essence"
	quest.0E69F2B7EA561D66.quest_desc: [
		"Draconium crops, awakened supremium and insanium farmland. You grow the rarest things in the pack."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Draconium Seeds, Awakened Supremium Ingot Block and Insanium Farmland and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
