	quest.10448753984D5250.title: "Supremium Armor"
	quest.10758FCC764BF760.quest_desc: [
		"Mystical Agriculture lets you grow almost any resource as a crop, from coal to nether stars."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r collect Inferium essence, craft a seed base, then use the Infusion Altar to make resource seeds. Each tier of essence (Inferium, Prudentium, Tertium, Imperium, Supremium, Insanium) unlocks better seeds. Some wheat seeds get you started."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Wheat Seeds and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.10758FCC764BF760.title: "Grow Your Resources"
	quest.108E13A3D93B04F4.quest_desc: [
		"Turns extra seeds back into essence."
		""
